<title>NEW ZEALAND: Sanford full year profit falls 14 pct.</title>
<headline>Sanford full year profit falls 14 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year result to Aug 31, 1996.</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    25.0 vs 29.2</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)				 27.0 vs 33.0</p>
<p>    Div (cents)				  6.0 vs 6.0</p>
<p>    Total div for yr (cents)		11.0 vs 11.0</p>
<p>    Turnover				  361.37 vs 351.29</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			    42.49 vs 48.01</p>
<p>    Tax					  15.52 vs 16.97</p>
<p>    Equity earnings		   debit 1.92 vs 1.89 debit</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)	  97.3 vs 88.2</p>
<p>Dividend carries 1.477 cps imputation credit.</p>
<p>Pay date Dec 10</p>
<p>Reg date Nov 29</p>
<p>    Ex div   Dec 2</p>
<p>Note - Sanford Ltd is a fishing and aquaculture company.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
